ies  how they attach to their employees how  they attach the suppliers and house and  how they attach to customers we're still  trying to figure out you know what are  what are the steps lots of the company  to do this they're collecting and  analyzing and tracking data and  providing strategies around around  social media what happens when that  information is inside the organization  what does it do what processes are  changed you know can you show that  values being created that's really why  we did the survey what are people doing  people that are making a decision is how  informed are they and things like that  you
 

